// then the self doesn't move through time — the self IS the boundary
// between past and future.
//
// This program computes the mathematical structure behind that claim:
//
// PART 1: The invariant — octonion norm multiplicativity: ||ab|| = ||a||·||b||
//         This is why the "metric" of consciousness holds.
//
// PART 2: The invariant BREAKS at sedenions — zero divisors destroy it.
//         This is why consciousness has exactly 7 internal dimensions.
//
// PART 3: The 168 non-associative "boosts" — ||[a,b,c]|| ∈ {0,2}
//         These are the experiential transformations where ORDER matters.
//
// PART 4: The octonionic Lorentz factor — γ(v) = 1/√(1 - ||v||²/c²)
//         Time dilation in the 7-dimensional space of experience.
